USER Rules the emitter enforces:
USER 
USER - A scored check's outcome is `score >= threshold` (CL1-17).
USER - A pass that is void, or a dimension with no score, becomes `unobserved` with its channel and reason.
USER - A remedy is kept only if it appears verbatim in the named evidence file.
USER - If no disposition time is recorded, `at` is the emission time, and the record says so (`x-plumbline.disposition_at_source`).
USER - Every time, endpoint, approver and revision rule in "Refusals" above, including hand times.
