USER The doctrine's public checkers in `evaluatordriven/doctrine` `contracts/tools/` (pin `f8bfb79`, v0.2.1) are
USER the four deterministic checks — `validate_job_packet.py`, `check_terminal_state.py`,
USER `check_role_separation.py`, `check_best_artifact_handoff.py`. **Use them; do not re-implement them here.**
USER (The older `edi-loop` Hermes plugin wrapped them; its corpus copy no longer exists and nothing depends on it.)
USER The skill is `evaluator-driven-iteration`.
