USER 
USER - Scripts run under `python3` (tested on 3.13) after `pip install -r requirements.txt`; under Hermes, the Hermes
USER   venv's Python works too.
USER - **Never hand-edit a derived schema.** Change `schemas/instance-extensions.json`, then run
