USER - If a schema and a doc disagree, the schema wins and the doc gets fixed — and if the schema is derived, the
USER   fix belongs in the instance layer or upstream in the corpus.
USER - Do not add prose instructions here that should be enforced elsewhere. If removing a line would not cause a
USER   mistake, cut it.
