USER | Kind | Refused when | Example line |
USER |---|---|---|
USER | `hand-time` | a time's only source is a hand line, a ledger line with no `writer`, a typed value with no ledger line behind it, or a server time no logger recorded | `  [hand-time] disposition.at inputs/custody.json:42 (inputs-no-ledger)` |
USER | `time` | under `--allow-hand-times`, a hand time is more than 60 s off its harness call (the switch silences nothing else); a model maker/evaluator has no harness log; a pass or control is linked to no call; a log call has no time at all; a ledger value differs from the live event log | `[time] startedAt: hand-entered 2026-10-20T11:13:00Z but harness log harness-maker-fixture.log#0 puts it at 2026-10-20T11:00:00Z (+780 s; tolerance ±60 s)` |
